estiges . They are not infinite on purpose — so the game doesn’t turn into endless grinding. Each prestige unlocks new content, mechanics, and automation. Compared to the first game, we added offline income (up to 12 hours). This is especially u","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114044367","verified_at":"2026-10-26T13:14:30Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4620670-1846651706692863","game_id":"steam-4620670","kind":"announcement","title":"Clicker Astro Planet 2 — Releases in 12 Days! Play the Demo Now","summary":"Clicker Astro Planet 2 launches in 12 days!The demo is available right now — play it while you can and see how the game feels.In the full version you will get:Cosmic Cats — interact with pets and receive unique bonusesBusinesses — develop interstellar enterprises for passive incomeExpanded ResearchMore Stellar UpgradesRandom EventsLevel SystemQuests and Space MissionsSettlements — create your own settlement, build houses and production, and receive new resourcesOffline Mode up to 12 hoursJoin ou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:48:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692863","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4620670-1845383656390550","game_id":"steam-4620670","kind":"announcement","title":"Bug Fixes","summary":"FixesFixed a bug with upgrades.Fixed a bug that caused a brief freeze when switching music tracks.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T05:37:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656390550","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4620670-1845383656389067","game_id":"steam-4620670","kind":"update","title":"Velocity Update","summary":"Progression is faster, and the new systems are easier to read.GameplaySpace Task costs are much lower.Research and excavation take much less time.Research keeps running in the background.A finished excavation is set to MAX automatically, at no Energy cost.Space Tasks now show Energy per second, whether a task lasts 0.3 seconds or 365.On your first session, the bonus Moon button appears after a short delay, then returns to its normal timer.When Research is fully unlocked, the upgrade button stays","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T12:30:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389067","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4620670-1840944183787202","game_id":"steam-4620670","kind":"announcement","title":"Research Access","summary":"Changes:Research system unlockedUpdated Discord link","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T20:35:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183787202","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:33:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4620670-1840944183779495","game_id":"steam-4620670","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Out! Play Clicker Astro Planet 2 Now!","summary":"Get ready for a cosmic adventure! Build your stellar empire, automate resource collection with space cats, and conquer mini-games. Try the free Clicker Astro Planet 2 Demo today and start your journey through the galaxy!If you encounter any problems, please let us know via the in-game feedback system. Your opinion is extremely important to us